   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Ser» + participle",
     "texto": [
      "The passive voice is formed with **ser** + **participle**, and the participle agrees with the subject: **O romance foi escrito** (the novel was written), **Os livros foram escritos** (the books were written).",
      "Who does the action goes with **por**: **escrito por uma autora** (written by an author)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Tenses",
     "texto": [
      "The tense is marked by **ser**: **foi** (was), **é** (is), **será** (will be), **era** (was). E.g. **O livro é lido por muitos** (the book is read by many)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
